 acknowledges posture change.\")\nscripts/enable-required-check.sh:911:    log \"CAUTION: restore target re-enables allow_deletions; operator acknowledges posture change\"\nscripts/enable-required-check.sh:912:    RESTORE_CAUTION_LINES+=(\"- **CAUTION:** restore target re-enables allow_deletions; operator acknowledges posture change.\")\nscripts/enable-required-check.sh:943:    log \"CAUTION: restore target removes admin enforcement; operator acknowledges posture change\"\nscripts/enable-required-check.sh:944:    RESTORE_CAUTION_LINES+=(\"- **CAUTION:** restore target removes admin enforcement; operator acknowledged via --i-understand-restore-removes-admin-enforcement.\")\nscripts/enable-required-check.sh:946:  restore_contexts=\"$(printf '%s' \"$RESTORE_TARGET_JSON\" | jq -r '.required_status_checks.contexts // [] | length')\"\nscripts/enable-required-check.sh:948:  if printf '%s' \"$RESTORE_TARGET_JSON\" | jq -e --arg ctx \"$REQUIRED_CONTEXT\" '(.required_status_checks // {}).contexts // [] | index($ctx) != null' >/dev/null 2>&1; then\nscripts/enable-required-check.sh:956:    log \"CAUTION: restore target removes required status checks; operator acknowledges posture change\"\nscripts/enable-required-check.sh:957:    RESTORE_CAUTION_LINES+=(\"- **CAUTION:** restore target removes required status checks; operator acknowledged via --i-understand-restore-removes-required-checks.\")\nscripts/enable-required-check.sh:963:    log \"CAUTION: restore target replaces required_status_checks.contexts with a non-canonical set; operator acknowledges posture change\"\nscripts/enable-required-check.sh:964:    RESTORE_CAUTION_LINES+=(\"- **CAUTION:** restore target replaces required_status_checks.contexts with a non-canonical set; operator acknowledged via --i-understand-restore-replaces-required-check-context.\")\nscripts/enable-required-check.sh:971:    log \"CAUTION: restore target disables strict mode; operator acknowledges posture change\"\nscripts/enable-required-check.sh:97